        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Soil functions are defined as bundles of soil processes that underpin the delivery of ecosystem services.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Soil functions describe the soil&apos;s capacity to support the ecosystem services essential for human well-being.</skos:definition>
