        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Soil threats are characterised by a negative trend in one or several soil properties, or are indicated directly by features observed in the field.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Soil threats are processes that damage soil and its functional properties, reducing the soil&apos;s capacity to provide ecosystem services.</skos:definition>
